---
import Layout from '../../features/services/layouts/Layout.astro';
import { excluded } from '../../features/services/lib/catalog';
---
<Layout indexable={true}>
 <section class="hero"><div><div class="eyebrow">KAOHSIUNG · LOCAL HELP</div><h1>家裡的小事，<br/>附近有人<em>幫你。</em></h1><p>清潔、收納、家具組裝與一般小修繕。<br/>說出你的需求與預算，讓合適的好幫手來報價。</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="/services/post">免費刊登需求 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="button secondary" href="/services/provider">我想提供服務</a></div><div class="trust"><span>✓ 刊登與媒合免費</span><span>✓ 需求人工審核</span><span>✓ 地址不公開</span></div></div>
 <div class="hero-art"><svg viewBox="0 0 400 275" aria-label="一起照顧家裡的小事" role="img"><circle cx="340" cy="42" r="28" fill="#f4d887"/><path d="M30 144 166 38l136 106v119H30z" fill="#f7f3e8"/><path d="M20 145 166 28l146 117" fill="none" stroke="#174c3c" stroke-width="13" stroke-linecap="round"/><rect x="129" y="158" width="68" height="105" rx="6" fill="#cad9c3"/><rect x="64" y="140" width="41" height="45" rx="4" fill="#b0c8b8"/><path d="M85 140v45m-21-22h41" stroke="#f7f3e8" stroke-width="4"/><rect x="224" y="140" width="41" height="45" rx="4" fill="#b0c8b8"/><path d="M245 140v45m-21-22h41" stroke="#f7f3e8" stroke-width="4"/><circle cx="318" cy="145" r="22" fill="#e7b889"/><path d="M296 136q4-28 27-18 21 6 17 25l-16-8-25 6" fill="#174c3c"/><path d="M302 172q16-10 33 0l17 70h-61z" fill="#d9b64e"/><path d="m301 189-36 23m69-24 22 25" stroke="#e7b889" stroke-width="13" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="m304 241-6 26m35-26 6 26" stroke="#174c3c" stroke-width="13" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="m355 169 9 93" stroke="#9f7b46" stroke-width="5"/><path d="m348 245-8 22h39l-12-22" fill="#174c3c"/><path d="M28 246q-24-38-13-57 31 13 26 48 4-49 25-55 17 28-24 64" fill="#83a480"/><path d="m16 246 6 21h27l5-21" fill="#c69c6a"/></svg><div class="art-caption"><span class="tick" aria-hidden="true">✓</span><div><strong>先確認需求，再放心約定</strong><br/>服務者經審核，雙方自行確認與結算</div></div></div></section>
 <section class="section"><div class="section-head"><h2>需要哪一種幫忙？</h2><p>從生活裡的小事開始</p></div><div class="grid"><a class="card category-card" href="/services/post?category=cleaning"><span class="category-icon" aria-hidden="true">✧</span><h3>居家清潔</h3><p>一般打掃、廚房浴室清潔<br/>把空間整理得清爽舒服</p></a><a class="card category-card" href="/services/post?category=organizing"><span class="category-icon" aria-hidden="true">▤</span><h3>收納整理</h3><p>衣櫃、房間與生活收納<br/>一起找回剛剛好的空間</p></a><a class="card category-card" href="/services/post?category=furniture"><span class="category-icon" aria-hidden="true">⌑</span><h3>家具組裝</h3><p>桌椅、層架與一般家具<br/>把新買的家具安頓好</p></a><a class="card category-card" href="/services/post?category=minor"><span class="category-icon" aria-hidden="true">⌁</span><h3>一般小修繕</h3><p>把手調整、簡單五金更換<br/>不涉及專業證照工程</p></a></div></section>
 <section class="section"><div class="how"><h2>三步驟，找到合適的好幫手</h2><div class="steps"><div><span class="step-number">01 · 說說你的需求</span><h3>刊登類別、地區與預算</h3><p>填寫希望的時間，可附私人照片。完整地址不會出現在案件列表。</p></div><div><span class="step-number">02 · 比較合適的報價</span><h3>人工審核後，開始媒合</h3><p>核准的服務者查看合適案件。你可以比較服務範圍，再選擇一位。</p></div><div><span class="step-number">03 · 完工後，確認完成</span><h3>雙方確認，自行結算</h3><p>服務者提交完工回報，客戶驗收。平台不代收款，也不抽成。</p></div></div></div></section>
 <section class="scope"><strong>先從安全的小事做起</strong><p>{excluded}遇到緊急危險情況，請洽相關專業單位。</p></section>
</Layout>
